As I recall, the aklys is described the in AD&D Unearthed Arcana book.  It is  
not a polearm, and it is not a spear thrower(an atlatl is a spear-thrower, so  
you might get confused).  But if you've ever seen an unidentified aklys, it is  
known as a "thonged club".  Basically, it is a hammer(or club) with a thong  
attached to the hammer, so that you can swing it with a greater range, and use  
the thong to trip people.  Also you can pull it back if you throw it.  I doubt  
if any of these functions apply in nethack.  But anyways, that's what it is.

